00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:56.010
All hail the King!

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.200
You're—

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:20.780
That's right.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:24.080
I'm Kandata.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.080
I... I have money.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.000
Take as—

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.330
I will.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:32.500
Shut up.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.090
Someone...

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.050
Someone help!

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.590
Some...

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.890
Oh, man.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.970
I told you to shut up.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.270
Here they come.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.480
There he is!
There he is!

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.730
This is fun.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.280
Seize him!

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.030
I'm over here!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:05.830
This is no game!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:21.130
Who wants to die next?

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.230
There he is!

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:33.210
Don't let him get away!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.670
Mommy, I'm gonna go see the parade.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.630
Don't stay out too late.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:38.460
I know!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.420
Sorry, mister!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.100
I'm hungry.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:04.360
Hey!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.410
Get me some food.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:27.220
Make way for the King.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:35.730
This day is a truly joyous day for our country.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:43.730
After a century of time, our country is walking the path to prosperity.

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:49.410
It is a truly and extremely joyous day.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.240
All hail the King!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.210
So fucking noisy.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.350
Thank you, my people.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.270
Having said that, my country is still small.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:27.240
Let us all join hands, cooperate, cheer each
other on, and wish for even greater prosperity.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:37.540
May patriotism and loyalty be shown by all, and days that...

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.670
An intruder!

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:43.750
Who be you?!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.130
Me?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.260
I'm Lord Kandata.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.310
And what do you, Kandata, want?

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.390
You are rude.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.020
No, you're fucking rude.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.390
You're so fucking loud!

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.480
What do you mean?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.810
This is my parade.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.150
You dare to call me rude?

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:08.280
King, do not be bothered with this man.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:11.360
Where are the gunners?! What are they doing?!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.740
Do something about him!

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.370
Outta my fucking way!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:30.550
It's about time this joke came to an end!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.590
All hail Lord Kandata!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.270
How dare you call me a joke when you are one yourself?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.560
That fool insulted my parade.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.440
I cannot forgive that monster!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.980
Never!!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.830
Sir, have you paid?

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.750
Kandata!

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:14.760
That was good.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.850
Why is he here?

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.140
Move it! Move it!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.640
Is it you?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.020
Are you the criminal named Kandata?

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.940
I see, you do look like a criminal.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.400
Who the fuck are you?

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:30.780
Me?

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:34.360
I see, you want to know my name?

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:36.620
I see, is that so?

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:38.910
My name is—

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.920
I look like a criminal?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.420
Take a look in the damn mirror.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.480
Give me...

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.150
Give me back my mommy.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.070
Sorry.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:12.610
Hey!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.650
Get me some food.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:19.700
My...

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:22.660
My mommy.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.830
You... fucking son of a...

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.540
There's Kandata!

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:35.260
Goddammit!

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.550
Ow...

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:16.340
Fuck...

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.940
Ow...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.250
A spider?

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:55.500
Aren't you afraid of me?

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:01.640
Don't you know how evil I am?

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:07.680
Like you understand.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:12.730
You're small, but I'm sure you have a life.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:19.700
No matter how small, taking it away like it's nothing would be just too damn sad.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.110
Eh?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.370
What am I? A priest?

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.960
I'm going crazy 'cause of that kid.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.380
Ow...

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.420
Well...

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.720
I guess it's time I leave.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.390
See ya.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:17.980
My people!

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.480
Behold!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:24.700
A pitiful man who has reduced himself to a brute.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.320
And you all know his name very well.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.080
Kandata.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:38.670
The crimes he has committed are so great that I couldn't possibly list them now.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:46.880
Above all, since he tried to kill me, the King, he must be prepared to fall to Hell.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:48.550
Kill him!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.050
Give him what he deserves!

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:51.560
See you in Hell!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.270
In Hell?

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:55.770
So you're coming too?

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.810
How many did you kill?

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.440
Kill him!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.070
What's so funny?

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:06.650
Do you not fear death?

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:10.120
Why not beg for your life?

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.200
You must be kidding.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.790
Then what does it mean to be alive?

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:18.370
There's nothing great about living in a world like this.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:24.460
You live a worthless life every single fucking day until you die.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:27.130
And I'd beg for something so worthless?

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.720
I don't care about this world.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.180
Nada.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:39.850
I'm so happy you put on such an amazing ceremony for a pitiful guy like me.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:42.560
Hell, I'm honored.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:45.690
Thanks a ton.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.780
You psychopath!

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.660
Let's get this started.

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.830
I'm getting tired here.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.500
Silence!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.290
I'll send you straight to Hell.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:14.510
Now!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.220
What the...

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.430
Where am I?

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.210
What the fuck?!

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.730
What are you doing?!

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.020
Stop!

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.360
Stop!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.040
You... murderer.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:12.550
Murderer!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.680
What the...

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.550
What the fuck?!

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:19.390
What's so funny?

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.600
Shut up! Shut up!

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:06.060
Stay back!

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.100
Fuck!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.900
What the fuck's going on?

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.150
What the fuck is this place?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:22.280
Kandata!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.000
Welcome to Hell.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.840
Someone...

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:47.730
Save me!!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.340
A spider's thread!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.020
I can make it.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.580
If I just keep climbing...

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.010
Me too...

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:48.260
Save me too.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.640
Stay back!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:51.270
Fuck!

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:52.850
Me too...

00:20:54.730 --> 00:21:08.030
Me too... Me too... Me too...

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:10.160
Stay back!

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:14.870
This spider's thread is mine!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:18.540
Who said you could use it too?!

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:23.090
Get off! Get off!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:29.970
